Z||000007||Standard||08-24-2000||05:26 AM||||I like just almost everything that they changed except the tail-lights.  IMHO, the GT lights are perfect how they are.  It also looks a little too much like a Camaro from the side..<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1989_side_of_fiero.jpg"> <P>If you look at Taijiguy's pics you can see they had this headlight style on the GT, too<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/89notchbackf.gif"> <P>IMNSHO, the notchback prototypes don't look too good.. way too rounded and smooth.<P>------------------<BR>Mike -- Golden Valley, MN<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 149,000 miles and counting!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif"> ||||reg||1
