Z||000009||286SE'S||08-24-2000||02:45 PM||||The austrailian link was mine, here it is again if anyone cares to re-visit it.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.pontiworld.com.au/newsletter/july2000/page3.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.pontiworld.com.au/newsletter/july2000/page3.html</A> <P>I don't think that the 89 Fieros were for sale or that they actually were even in Austrailia. Reading the text in the Web-site made me think that the cars were in a GM owned lot in America.<P>The double headlights!? not leaving much room for the radiator.<BR>Terry||||reg||1
